    ],
    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@value": "Anne & Gilbert - The Musical"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@value": "<style>\n.location-page-temp {\n    display: block!important;\n}\n</style>\n<p>Experience Canada's greatest love story in the critically acclaimed and widely loved musical <i>Anne & Gilbert</i>. Featuring a 20-member cast and orchestra, <i>Anne & Gilbert</i> has become a Canadian theatre sensation with the Toronto Star calling it 'a marvel'and proclaiming 'the joy of the experience makes this one a winner'.<br /><br />\n\nHailed in Variety as 'delightful' and 'utterly charming,' <i>Anne & Gilbert</i> is the story of Anne Shirley's journey into young adulthood as she experiences her first job, university and a tumultuous romance with Gilbert Blythe.<br /><br />\n\nAward-winning songs, memorable comedy and drama make <i>Anne & Gilbert</i> unforgettable family entertainment.<br /><br />\n\nBased on the novels <i>Anne of the Island</i> and <i>Anne of Avonlea</i> by L.M. Montgomery.</p>\n\n<p><b>Please note that this event is reserved for those 4 years and older.</b> <br />\n<i>Children under 4 are not permitted.</i></p>\n\n\n<head>\n<style>\nimg {\n  float: left;\n}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n\n\n\n\n<p><a href='https://music.apple.com/us/album/anne-gilbert/217539909'><img src='https://ticketpro.s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/ww3/images_event/2024/hollandcollege/agdownload.png' style='width:150px;height:149px;'></a>\n<a href='https://music.apple.com/us/album/anne-gilbert/217539909' target='_blank'><br><ul><b>Download the Anne & Gilbert Original Cast Recording<br>Selected Songs from the East Coast Music Award Winning Recording.</b></ul></p></a>\n\n</body>\n</html>\n\n\n\n\n\n"
      },
      {
        "@value": "<p>Experience Canada's greatest love story in the critically acclaimed and widely loved musical <i>Anne & Gilbert</i>. Featuring a 20-member cast and orchestra, <i>Anne & Gilbert</i> has become a Canadian theatre sensation with the Toronto Star calling it 'a marvel'and proclaiming 'the joy of the experience makes this one a winner'.</p>\n\n<p>Hailed in Variety as 'delightful' and 'utterly charming,' <i>Anne & Gilbert</i> is the story of Anne Shirley's journey into young adulthood as she experiences her first job, university and a tumultuous romance with Gilbert Blythe.</p>\n\n<p>Award-winning songs, memorable comedy and drama make <i>Anne & Gilbert</i> unforgettable family entertainment.</p>\n\n<p>Based on the novels <i>Anne of the Island</i> and <i>Anne of Avonlea</i> by L.M. Montgomery.</p>\n\n<p><b>Please note that this event is reserved for those 4 years and older.</b> <br />\n<i>Children under 4 are not permitted.</i></p>\n\n<br>\n<hr>\n<br>\n\n<p><span style='font-size: medium;'><span style='color: #008000;'><u><b>The Anne of Green Gables Package</b></u></span></span><br />\nExplore Anne's world, then watch Anne fall in love. The Anne of Green Gables Package - Five Great Anne attractions for one low price!</p>\n<p><b> The package includes admission to the following:\n</b></p>\n\n<p> - Parks Canada's Green Gables Heritage Place<br />\n - The Anne of Green Gables Museum<br />\n - The L. M. Montgomery Birthplace<br />\n - The Site of L. M. Montgomery's Cavendish Home<br />\n - Anne & Gilbert - The Musical (select dates May to October)<br /></p>\n\n<p>When purchasing this package you will be given one ticket which entitles you to one admission to each of the five attractions. You must present this ticket to each attraction to gain admission.</p>\n\n<!--<p><b><i>*Please note: The L.M. Montgomery Birthplace (New London) opens on May 21, 2024. In place of admission to the Birthplace,  purchasers of the Anne of Green Gables Package will receive a CD copy of the East Coast Award Winning Original Cast Recording.</i></b></p>-->\n\n<head>\n<style>\nimg {\n  float: left;\n}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n\n\n\n\n<p><a href='https://music.apple.com/us/album/anne-gilbert/217539909'><img src='https://ticketpro.s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/ww3/images_event/2024/hollandcollege/agdownload.png' style='width:150px;height:149px;'></a>\n<a href='https://music.apple.com/us/album/anne-gilbert/217539909' target='_blank'><br><ul><b>Download the Anne & Gilbert Original Cast Recording<br>Selected Songs from the East Coast Music Award Winning Recording.</b></ul></p></a>\n\n</body>\n</html>\n\n\n"
      }
    ],
