    ],
    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@value": "Leyendas (Legends) - En Movimiento Teatro (Mexico) - Liverpool International Theatre Festival"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@value": "Synopsis: In the heart of Mexico City, time stands still within the shadowy walls of The Swan Tavern. As the clock strikes eleven, stories and reality begin to blur, and the tavern fills with echoes of the past. Through haunting narrative and spectral re-enactments, classic Mexican legends come alive — from Don Juan Manuel and La Llorona to rumours of the Devil himself offering patrons their heart's desire for a terrible price. As a violent storm rages outside, the clients must decide whether they are merely hearing stories, or have become part of one.\n\n<style>\n\n@media screen and (max-width:728px) {\niframe{width:100%!important;}\n}\n</style>"
      }
