    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@value": "<p>One Day. The Best of Devour!. Short on time? Go all in for one unforgettable day.<br>\nDevour! Day Packages bundle some of the Festival's best films, food, workshops, parties and live entertainment into easy, curated experiences. Pick your day, follow your appetite and let us take care of the itinerary. Every Day Package also includes one complimentary film ticket—a $15 value—to use at another eligible screening during the Festival.\n</p>\n\n<style>\n.location-page-temp {display: none!important;}\n.location-event-temp {display: none!important;}\n</style>"
