    ],
    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@value": "CUNTRESSAS Canadian Tour in Halifax"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@value": "\n<p>Your Intergalactic C*NTRESSAS are ready for lift-off</p>\n\n<p>\nFrom RuPaul's Drag Race UK vs The World Season 3, we're bringing you an out-of-this-world lineup:\n<br>\nThe fashion mannequin Sminty Drop\n<br>\nThe Filipina goddess from the UK nation Zahirah Zapanta<br>\n\nThe mother of the season, Mariah Balenciaga\n<br>\nAnd your reigning queen of the mother-tucking world, GAWDLAND</p>\n\n<p>\n\nServing you the ultimate fantasy with electrifying group numbers, jaw-dropping solos, iconic duos, exclusive meet & greets, and so much more... hosted by Emaan La'Belle and Canada's Drag Race Season 6 Lip-Sync Assassin and Runner-up Eboni La'Belle!</p>\n\n"
      }
    ],
