      {
        "@value": "<!--<b>2026/2027 SEASON TICKETS: <a href='/en/pages/1700388334' target='_blank'><u>CLICK HERE</u></b></a><br><br>-->\n\n\n<strong>The Metalfab MHL Cup Champions are back</strong><br><br>\nAfter an unforgettable 2025-26 championship season, the <strong>Truro Jr. A Bearcats</strong> are back on home ice for another year of hard-hitting, fast-paced Maritime Junior Hockey League action.<br><br>\nThere's nothing quite like a Bearcats game night. Come out and <strong>support your local team</strong>, bring the family, make some noise and experience the action live at the Rath Eastlink Community Centre.<br><br>\nWhether you've been following the Bearcats for years or you're checking out your first game, there's plenty happening all night long. Fans can enjoy <strong>prizes and giveaways, in-game activations, crowd cams, intermission contests and other game-night fun</strong> in addition to all the action on the ice.<br><br>\nSeason Tickets are available at the RECC Box Office and are a great deal for fans who want to catch all the regular-season action. Lock in your seat for the season and be there for every big goal, big save and big moment at the RECC!<br><br>\nSeptember 27, 2026 - March 6, 2027<br>\nRECC Arena<br>\n<a href='https://www.google.com/maps/search/625+Abenaki+Road,+Truro,+NS+B2N+0G6?entry=gmail&source=g' target='_blank' rel='noopener noreferrer'>625 Abenaki Road, Truro, NS B2N 0G6</a><br>\n<br>\n<strong>Ticket & Venue Information</strong><br><i>\n* Students / Military must provide ID<br>\n* Youth 12 years and under must be accompanied and supervised by an adult / guardian 16 years or older<br>\n* Children 5 and under are free and do not require a ticket<br>\n* Family Four Pack includes 2 adults and 2 students/youths - no exceptions or substitutions<br>\n* Season Pass is <em>ONE</em> ticket for the entire season with assigned seating. Individual game tickets are General Admission<br>\n* Tickets have no cash / exchange value<br>\n* Tickets are non-refundable. In the event of a rescheduled game, original tickets may be used to attend the new date<br>\n* No Re-Entry<br>\n* Subject to Bag Searches Upon Entry<br></i>\n<br>\n<strong>About the Bearcats</strong><br>\nThe <strong>Truro Bearcats</strong> are a Junior 'A' hockey team based in Truro, Nova Scotia, and one of six Nova Scotia teams competing in the <strong>Maritime Junior Hockey League (MHL)</strong>.<br><br>\nFormed in 1997 as a member of the Maritime Junior A Hockey League, the Bearcats have built a proud tradition of competitive hockey in Truro, highlighted most recently by their <strong>2025-26 Metalfab MHL Cup Championship</strong>.<br><br>\nThe Bearcats play their home games at the <strong>Rath Eastlink Community Centre</strong>, bringing exciting junior hockey and an entertaining game-night experience to the community throughout the season.<br><br>\n<b>RECC Box Office Hours:</b>\n<ul><li>Weekdays: 6:00 AM - 9:00 PM</li>\n<li>Weekends: 8:00 AM - 8:00 PM</li></ul>\n<b>Online Tickets:</b> Available anytime, up to 1.5 hours after the game has started.\n\n"
      }
    ],
