    ],
    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@value": "Dragstravaganza presents Spooktacular"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@value": "<p>Halloween is for everyone—but let's be honest, there aren't always enough wickedly fun options for adults! This year, Dragstravaganza has you covered with our first-ever Halloween show at The Marigold Cultural Centre!<br><br>\n\nThe cast of Dragstravaganza is bringing you Spooktacular—a bloody good, unforgettable evening packed with electrifying performances, fabulous frights, and plenty of Halloween mischief!<br><br>\n\nSo dust off that costume you've been dying to show off, bring your friends, and join us for an ooky spooky good time you won't soon forget!<br><br>\n\nKids are welcome, but viewer discretion is advised.</p\n\n"
      }
    ],
