    ],
    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@value": "Island Jazz Plays TV Themes"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@value": "<p>Island Jazz presents TV Music featuring music made famous by TV shows over the decades, performed by the Charlottetown Jazz Ensemble and the Island Jazz Quartet with vocalist Kelley Mooney - Friday November 20th 7:30pm at the Scott MacAuley Performance Hall. You'll hear jazz arrangements of classic TV music from favourite shows including Sesame Street, Spiderman, Mission Impossible, and M*A*S*H, Sanford & Son, both the Gilmore and Golden Girls and Get Smart too, plus WKRP, The Odd Couple, Three's Company, Cheers, and more.</p> <br> \n\n<p>The Charlottetown Jazz Ensemble is celebrating it's 30th anniversary this season! The band features Island musicians with a wide range of backgrounds, from gifted students to seasoned professionals, and won the 2026 Music PEI Award for Jazz. Island Jazz has been presenting live music since 2013 in PEI including more than 450 shows at Baba's Lounge in Charlottetown featuring the best PEI musicians in a variety of styles and genres.</p> <br> \n\n\n<style>\n.location-page-temp {\n    display: block!important;\n}\n</style>"
      }
    ],
