    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@value": "The Lost Sparkle - The Meaning of Christmas - Presented by Fandango Musical Players"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@value": "<p>Disaster has struck at the North pole!! Just one hour to launch and all of the powerful Sparkle has disappeared!! How will the world's children get all their gifts without it? Join Fandango Musical Players at the Scott McAulay Performing Arts Centre as we follow Santa and Rudolph in a race against time to find.... The Lost Sparkle!! An original heartfelt magical story that's perfect for adults and children of all ages, filled with music, dance, and laughter. The Lost Sparkle will have you on the edge of your seat and leave you feeling warm, happy, satisfied, and ready for the festive season!!</p> <br> \n\n\n<style>\n.location-page-temp {\n    display: block!important;\n}\n</style>"
      }
