    "http://schema.org/url": [
      {
        "@id": "https://tproatlantic.ticketpro.ca/en/pages/1706779758/performances/HOL13LS26"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@value": "Brown Sisters Christmas Concert"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@value": "<p>Our family is excited to head back to the Florence Simmons Performance Hall for a 2026 Charity Christmas Concert!</p>\n\n<p>We're Kady, Karyn, Maria, Rachel, and Rebekah—five sisters who grew up singing and playing music together. Christmas was always celebrated big at home, and we're excited to celebrate big with you all! Expect a night full of familiar holiday classics, cozy family stories, and a special appearance of some of the next generation of family singers.</p>\n\n<p>Most importantly, this night is all about wrapping our community in love. Ticket proceeds are going directly to support our charity partner this year: Lennon House. We are beyond grateful to our sponsor, Provincial Credit Union, for helping cover the setup so that every single dollar raised goes straight to this wonderful cause! </p>\n\n<p>Gather your kids, parents, grandparents, and favorite people to come share a joy-filled night of music and togetherness with us.</p>\n"
      }
    ],
