    ],
    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@value": "Brian Patafie: He's Funny as PUCK!"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@value": "<p><b>16+ Event</b></p><br>\n\n<p>On Wednesday April 14th 2027, Greenwood Nova Scotia raised and longtime NHL Calgary Flames Athletic Trainer turned Standup Comedian Brian Patafie will be coming to Holland College in Charlottetown PEI and he will be bringing his 'FUNNY AS PUCK' Show to the Florence Simmons Performance Hall for one night only. Brian has chosen a cast of some of North America's funniest standup comedians to join him on all of his Atlantic Canada Shows and for this show only his sponsors are offering SPECIAL $10.00 STUDENT TICKETS!.</p><br>\n\n<p>In May of 2021 Brian (affectionately referred to as Comedy's Original Enter-Trainer) started performing in front of appreciative comedy aficionados all over North America and the United Kingdom and he guarantees his 2027 show will again keep the audience laughing from start to finish. Come and listen to Brian share his adventures from his dysfunctional upbringing in a military home, his life of becoming a new father well into his forties and some hockey stories he has blended into an outrageous standup comedy routine. WELL, here is your opportunity to enjoy an evening with one of the most charismatic and entertaining figures from the world of professional sports as he shares his interesting and somewhat broken and flawed life stories in a humorous fashion on stage.</p><br>\n\n"
      }
    ],
