    ],
    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@value": "Brian Patafie is FUNNY AS PUCK"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@value": " On Saturday April 17th 2027 longtime NHL Calgary Flames Athletic Trainer turned Standup Comedian Brian Patafie will be coming to Woodstock New Brunswick and he will be bringing his 'FUNNY AS PUCK' Show to the McCain Community Theatre for one night only. Brian has chosen a cast of some of North America's funniest standup comedians to join him on all of his Atlantic Canada Shows and for this show in Woodstock Brian is going back to his 'Hockey Roots' and this show will serve as a fundraiser for the Western Valley Panthers Hockey Club.<br><br>\nIn May of 2021 Brian (affectionately referred to as Comedy's Original Enter-Trainer) started performing in front of appreciative comedy aficionados all over North America and the United Kingdom and he guarantees his 2027 show will again keep the audience laughing from start to finish. Come and listen to Brian share his adventures from his dysfunctional upbringing in a military home, his life of becoming a new father well into his forties and some hockey stories he has blended into an outrageous standup comedy routine. WELL, here is your opportunity to not only enjoy an evening with one of the most charismatic and entertaining figures from the world of professional sports but a chance to help your local Junior Hockey Team as well while Brian shares his interesting and somewhat broken and flawed life stories in a humorous fashion on stage.\n\n<style>\n@media screen and (max-width: 600px){iframe{width:100%;}}\n</style>\n"
      }
